{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a long-armed thief. Your arm is like a yucky snake.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/20c06b2d63de9c565c624c90b298b831.poster.avif?t=1772655808\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/20c06b2d63de9c565c624c90b298b831.webm?t=1772655808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/20c06b2d63de9c565c624c90b298b831.mp4?t=1772655808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Arms Are Longer Now is a 2D stealth-comedy game. With your disgusting long arm, you\u2019ll avoid security systems, steal whatever isn\u2019t bolted down, put a sock on your hand and flirt with a lonely guard - whatever it takes to pull off the perfect heist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arm that retracts like a vacuum cord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hard-boiled detective on your tail (or shoulder?), one week from retirement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riches like you wouldn\u2019t believe (at least 60 bucks!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646170/extras/9936fae1aa2fff0a850a4e15e1c032cd.avif?t=1772655808\" width=600 height=296 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646170?t=1772655808","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646170?t=1772655808","capsule_imag